## Data Models (internal/model/)

```go
type Expense struct {
    ID       types.ID
    Name     string
    Amount   types.Unsigned
    Group    types.Group
    Category types.Category
    Date     time.Time
    Note     string
}

type UserSheetMapping struct {
    ID              types.ID
    UserID          types.ID
    Username        string
    FullName        string
    SpreadSheetsURL string
    CreatedAt       time.Time
    UpdatedAt       time.Time
    Status          MappingStatus
}
```

